        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG124 , Stainless Steel Dover Lever With Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of stainless steel, the Dover Leverset is great for both commercial and residential applications. It is easy to instal and will fit standard 2-1/8 inch pre-drill doors. The unique shape of the lever along with the concealed screw mounting on the rose features the clean lines and minimalist appearance that is so popular for modern decor. The SIG124-203 Lever is ADA compliant. Available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG124-specifications.gif?v=1704354625\" width=\"398\" height=\"225\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG124 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-dover-leverset-with-square-rose-ahi-sig124-204\"><b>AHI SIG124-204 Stainless Steel Dover Lever With Square Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel AHI SIG124 Modern Dover Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For residential or commercial applications</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors)</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Premium latch requires only 28° rotation to retract latchbolt</li>\r\n<li>Meets standards of the <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SIG124 Stainless Steel Dover Leverset With Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5.31\" (135 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Width: 0.28\" (7 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Width at Rose Mount: 0.79\" (20 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Thickness: 0.79\" (20 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.17\" (55 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 0.31\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.52\" (64 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 0.35\" (9 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Lever is surface mounted (mounting plate screws to the doors face).</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. For use with a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole pre-drilled door. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Dover Leverset With Round Rose, AHI SIG124",
                "description": "AHI SIG124 , Stainless Steel Dover Lever With Round Rose - Made out of stainless steel, the Dover Leverset is great for both commercial and residential applications. It is easy to instal and will fit standard 2-1/8 inch pre-drill doors. The unique shape of the lever along with the concealed screw mounting on the rose features the clean lines and minimalist appearance that is so popular for modern decor. The SIG124-203 Lever is ADA compliant. Available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.",
